    <briefdescription>
<para>One client connection of the daemon: reads serialized ValueTree messages from the client and sends each result back. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Deserializes incoming binary ValueTree blocks for connection metadata, request cancellation, and queued request rows under its <ref refid="namespaceId_1aec5b34525c30f9236d01d954c002e497" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">Id::connection</ref> row in the model. When a request row receives <ref refid="namespaceId_1a4d0c202389586ef61d84b669241a4739" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">Id::result</ref>, sends the binary JSON-RPC payload to the client and removes the row. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
